---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { SITE } from "../../data/site";
---
<BaseLayout title="How to Buy Yoga Leggings Wholesale" description="The complete guide to sourcing quality yoga leggings at factory prices. Learn about MOQ, pricing structures, quality indicators, and how to negotiate with suppliers.">
  <section style="background:var(--color-primary);color:white;">
    <div style="max-width:56rem;margin:0 auto;padding:4rem 1.5rem;text-align:center;">
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:0.75rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">
        <span style="font-size:1.5rem;">🩱</span>
        <span style="font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--color-accent-light);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.1);padding:0.2rem 0.75rem;border-radius:9999px;">Beginner</span>
        <span style="font-size:0.75rem;color:#94a3b8;">8 min read</span>
      </div>
      <h1 style="font-size:2.25rem;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:1rem;">How to Buy Yoga Leggings Wholesale</h1>
      <p style="color:#94a3b8;max-width:42rem;margin:0 auto;">The complete guide to sourcing quality yoga leggings at factory prices. Learn about MOQ, pricing structures, quality indicators, and how to negotiate with suppliers.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div style="max-width:56rem;margin:0 auto;padding:2.5rem 1.5rem;">
    <div style="background:white;border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:1rem;padding:2rem;margin-bottom:2rem;">
      
      <h2 style="font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--color-primary);margin-top:2rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Why Buy Yoga Leggings Wholesale?</h2>
      <p style="font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--color-text-light);line-height:1.8;">Yoga leggings are one of the highest-margin activewear categories globally. A factory can produce quality leggings for $6-12 per piece, while retail prices on Amazon and Shopify range from $35-65. Even at wholesale, you are looking at 70-80% margins before shipping - one of the best ratios in e-commerce.</p>
      
      
      <h2 style="font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--color-primary);margin-top:2rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Understanding MOQ (Minimum Order Quantity)</h2>
      <p style="font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--color-text-light);line-height:1.8;">Most factories set MOQ at 30-50 pieces per style per color. This is low enough for small sellers to test products without large upfront investment. Key insight: if a factory requires 300+ MOQ for custom colors, start with their in-stock colors to test demand first, then scale up to custom production once you know what sells.</p>
      
      
      <h2 style="font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--color-primary);margin-top:2rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Key Quality Indicators to Check</h2>
      <p style="font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--color-text-light);line-height:1.8;">undefined</p>
      <ul style="margin-top:0.75rem;padding-left:1.5rem;font-size:0.9rem;color:var(--color-text-light);line-height:1.8;"><li style="margin-bottom:0.4rem;">Fabric composition: 75% Nylon + 25% Spandex is the gold standard for buttery-soft feel</li><li style="margin-bottom:0.4rem;">Gram weight: 280gsm or higher for squat-proof coverage</li><li style="margin-bottom:0.4rem;">Seam construction: 4-needle flatlock stitching prevents chafing</li><li style="margin-bottom:0.4rem;">Elastic waistband: Should snap back without deformation after 100 stretches</li><li style="margin-bottom:0.4rem;">Color fastness: Ask for test reports (ISO 105-C06) to ensure colors do not bleed</li></ul>
      
      <h2 style="font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--color-primary);margin-top:2rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">How Pricing Works</h2>
      <p style="font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--color-text-light);line-height:1.8;">Factory pricing follows a tiered structure: 30-100 pieces gets you base pricing ($10-14/pc), 100-300 pieces gets 5-8% off, 300-500 pieces gets 8-12% off, and 500+ pieces can reach 12-15% off. Always ask for a price sheet before negotiating - most factories have published rates that are 20-30% above their actual floor.</p>
      
      
      <h2 style="font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--color-primary);margin-top:2rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Red Flags to Watch Out For</h2>
      <p style="font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--color-text-light);line-height:1.8;">undefined</p>
      <ul style="margin-top:0.75rem;padding-left:1.5rem;font-size:0.9rem;color:var(--color-text-light);line-height:1.8;"><li style="margin-bottom:0.4rem;">Refuses to send samples before bulk order</li><li style="margin-bottom:0.4rem;">Prices too low to be realistic (under $5/pc for nylon-spandex)</li><li style="margin-bottom:0.4rem;">No factory visit or video call option</li><li style="margin-bottom:0.4rem;">Cannot provide OEKO-TEX or BSCI certificates</li><li style="margin-bottom:0.4rem;">Vague about production timeline and lead time</li></ul>
      
    </div>

    <h2 style="font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--color-primary);margin-bottom:1.25rem;text-align:center;">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.75rem;margin-bottom:2.5rem;">
      
      <details style="background:white;border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:0.75rem;overflow:hidden;">
        <summary style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:1rem 1.25rem;cursor:pointer;list-style:none;gap:1rem;">
          <span style="font-weight:600;color:var(--color-text);font-size:0.9rem;">What is the typical MOQ for yoga leggings wholesale?</span>
          <svg style="width:1.25rem;height:1.25rem;color:var(--color-text-light);flex-shrink:0;" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <div style="padding:0.75rem 1.25rem 1.25rem;font-size:0.875rem;color:var(--color-text-light);line-height:1.7;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border);">Standard MOQ is 30-50 pieces per style per color at most factories. Some offer sample orders of 1-5 pieces at near-retail pricing. For custom colors or custom designs, MOQ typically starts at 100-300 pieces per style.</div>
      </details>
      
      <details style="background:white;border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:0.75rem;overflow:hidden;">
        <summary style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:1rem 1.25rem;cursor:pointer;list-style:none;gap:1rem;">
          <span style="font-weight:600;color:var(--color-text);font-size:0.9rem;">How can I verify quality before placing a bulk order?</span>
          <svg style="width:1.25rem;height:1.25rem;color:var(--color-text-light);flex-shrink:0;" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <div style="padding:0.75rem 1.25rem 1.25rem;font-size:0.875rem;color:var(--color-text-light);line-height:1.7;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border);">Order samples (1-5 pieces) first. Check the fabric weight (280gsm+), seam quality (flatlock stitching), and elastic recovery. Request OEKO-TEX fabric certificates and ask for a video call with the factory to see production firsthand.</div>
      </details>
      
      <details style="background:white;border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:0.75rem;overflow:hidden;">
        <summary style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:1rem 1.25rem;cursor:pointer;list-style:none;gap:1rem;">
          <span style="font-weight:600;color:var(--color-text);font-size:0.9rem;">What is a fair wholesale price for yoga leggings?</span>
          <svg style="width:1.25rem;height:1.25rem;color:var(--color-text-light);flex-shrink:0;" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <div style="padding:0.75rem 1.25rem 1.25rem;font-size:0.875rem;color:var(--color-text-light);line-height:1.7;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border);">Factory-direct pricing for quality leggings (75% Nylon, 25% Spandex, 280gsm+) ranges from $8-14 per piece depending on complexity. Budget options at $5-8 exist but often use thinner fabric (200-240gsm) that is not squat-proof.</div>
      </details>
      
      <details style="background:white;border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:0.75rem;overflow:hidden;">
        <summary style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:1rem 1.25rem;cursor:pointer;list-style:none;gap:1rem;">
          <span style="font-weight:600;color:var(--color-text);font-size:0.9rem;">Can I get custom logo leggings with low MOQ?</span>
          <svg style="width:1.25rem;height:1.25rem;color:var(--color-text-light);flex-shrink:0;" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <div style="padding:0.75rem 1.25rem 1.25rem;font-size:0.875rem;color:var(--color-text-light);line-height:1.7;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border);">Yes, most factories offer custom logo starting at 50 pieces per style with Heat Transfer or Screen Print techniques. Turnaround is 7-10 days for custom logo production. Woven labels and hang tags require higher MOQ (300+ pieces).</div>
      </details>
      
      <details style="background:white;border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:0.75rem;overflow:hidden;">
        <summary style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:1rem 1.25rem;cursor:pointer;list-style:none;gap:1rem;">
          <span style="font-weight:600;color:var(--color-text);font-size:0.9rem;">How do I negotiate better prices with suppliers?</span>
          <svg style="width:1.25rem;height:1.25rem;color:var(--color-text-light);flex-shrink:0;" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <div style="padding:0.75rem 1.25rem 1.25rem;font-size:0.875rem;color:var(--color-text-light);line-height:1.7;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border);">Always ask for the price sheet first - it is usually inflated by 20-30%. Mention that you are comparing multiple suppliers. Commit to a 6-month relationship rather than one-time orders. Volume commitments of 500+ pieces across multiple styles unlock the best pricing.</div>
      </details>
      
    </div>

    <div style="background:var(--color-secondary);border-radius:1.5rem;padding:2rem;text-align:center;">
      <h2 style="font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--color-primary);margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Have More Questions?</h2>
      <p style="font-size:0.875rem;color:var(--color-text-light);margin-bottom:1.25rem;">Get personalized answers for your specific business on WhatsApp.</p>
      <a href={SITE.whatsappLink} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:0.5rem;background:var(--color-whatsapp);color:white;padding:0.875rem 2rem;border-radius:9999px;font-weight:700;">Ask on WhatsApp</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "FAQPage",
    "mainEntity": [
    {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "What is the typical MOQ for yoga leggings wholesale?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Standard MOQ is 30-50 pieces per style per color at most factories. Some offer sample orders of 1-5 pieces at near-retail pricing. For custom colors or custom designs, MOQ typically starts at 100-300 pieces per style."
        }
    },
    {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "How can I verify quality before placing a bulk order?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Order samples (1-5 pieces) first. Check the fabric weight (280gsm+), seam quality (flatlock stitching), and elastic recovery. Request OEKO-TEX fabric certificates and ask for a video call with the factory to see production firsthand."
        }
    },
    {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "What is a fair wholesale price for yoga leggings?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Factory-direct pricing for quality leggings (75% Nylon, 25% Spandex, 280gsm+) ranges from $8-14 per piece depending on complexity. Budget options at $5-8 exist but often use thinner fabric (200-240gsm) that is not squat-proof."
        }
    },
    {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Can I get custom logo leggings with low MOQ?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes, most factories offer custom logo starting at 50 pieces per style with Heat Transfer or Screen Print techniques. Turnaround is 7-10 days for custom logo production. Woven labels and hang tags require higher MOQ (300+ pieces)."
        }
    },
    {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "How do I negotiate better prices with suppliers?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Always ask for the price sheet first - it is usually inflated by 20-30%. Mention that you are comparing multiple suppliers. Commit to a 6-month relationship rather than one-time orders. Volume commitments of 500+ pieces across multiple styles unlock the best pricing."
        }
    }
],
  })} />
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
    "itemListElement": [
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": SITE.url },
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Resources", "item": SITE.url + "/resources" },
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": "How to Buy Yoga Leggings Wholesale", "item": SITE.url + "/resources/buy-yoga-leggings-wholesale" },
    ],
  })} />
</BaseLayout>
